# Unreal build output, per-machine state and IDE files (architecture.md 8.4).
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
**/Binaries/
**/Intermediate/
*.sln
*.VC.db
.vs/
# Engine plugins copy their sample files here on editor start (PixelStreaming2
# web server scripts); they are engine content and never committed.
Samples/
# The engine needs unreal/Verse/Build/ (platform icons and resources); the root
# .gitignore ignores every folder named build, so it is re-included here.
!Build/
# Written by the cook (open order, chunk layers); never committed.
Build/*/FileOpenOrder/
Build/*/ChunkLayerInfo/
